      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `consume_event.py` that consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue, I will use the Google Cloud Pub/Sub service. This service is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code by the import of the `google.cloud.pubsub_v1` module and the use of the `SubscriberClient` class. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860502489,
